    {
      "id": "ZoyK6bEoKZOAacu3SRHIU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 198.03186856408718,
      "y": 65.19867927530925,
      "width": 569.7996215820312,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 255264073,
      "version": 946,
      "versionNonce": 1190045929,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786098447508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Two playeres take turn by turn into a 7*7 grid \n2. Disc falls in the lowest row in selected column\n3. Game ends when: \n    a. Player wins - diagonal, plus 4 consecutive disks\n    b. All cells filled - DRAW\n4. Inavalid Moves - \n    a. Already full column\n    b. same player consecutive\n    c. moving after result is found\n\nOut of scope: \n    a.  Is this backend only game or UI also?\n** important because getBoardState() or getValidMoves()\n    b. Concurrent games\n    c. Move history\n    d. undo\n    e. board resizing",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Two playeres take turn by turn into a 7*7 grid \n2. Disc falls in the lowest row in selected column\n3. Game ends when: \n    a. Player wins - diagonal, plus 4 consecutive disks\n    b. All cells filled - DRAW\n4. Inavalid Moves - \n    a. Already full column\n    b. same player consecutive\n    c. moving after result is found\n\nOut of scope: \n    a.  Is this backend only game or UI also?\n** important because getBoardState() or getValidMoves()\n    b. Concurrent games\n    c. Move history\n    d. undo\n    e. board resizing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1fBtrW3GRbwvCbvzW46SR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 795.0097118584625,
      "y": 58.72214592654183,
      "width": 601.6395263671875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1878610921,
      "version": 701,
      "versionNonce": 1108415751,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786098424946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Game - Orchestrator. Holds board state, Player turns game\n             state, enforces game rules. checks game wins and \nall at each turn\n2. Players - simple player with color and name (maybe)\n3. Board - 7*7 grid. owns grid state, handles color placement.\n              tells if column is full or not, disc connectivity. \nNo connection to players.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Game - Orchestrator. Holds board state, Player turns game\n             state, enforces game rules. checks game wins and \nall at each turn\n2. Players - simple player with color and name (maybe)\n3. Board - 7*7 grid. owns grid state, handles color placement.\n              tells if column is full or not, disc connectivity. \nNo connection to players.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
